          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. A mother is 5 times her daughter’s age. In 6 years’ time, the mother will be 3 times her daughter’s age. How old is the daughter now?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.541,
            0.847,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. Two friends, Gauri and Naina, are cowherds. One day, they pass each other on the road with their cows. Gauri says to Naina, “You have twice as many cows as I do”. Naina says, “That’s true, but if I gave you three of my cows, we would each have the same number of cows”. How many cows do Gauri and Naina have?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.644,
            0.724,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. I run a small dosa cart and my expenses are as follows:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.668,
            0.584,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Rent for the dosa cart is `5000 per day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.692,
            0.845,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• The cost of making one dosa (including all the ingredients and fuel) is `10."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.195,
            0.734,
            0.847,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) If I can sell 100 dosas a day, what should be the selling price of my dosa to make a profit of `2000?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.776,
            0.846,
            0.815
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) If my customers are willing to pay only `50 for a dosa, how many dosas should I aim to sell in a day to make a profit of `2000?"
